m1	645,964,1210,1108		The chain of chords of the major mode, f + a₁ - C + E₁ - G + b₁ - d: round braces above join the minor chords a₁-C-E₁ and E₁-G-b₁, square braces below the major chords f-a₁-C, C-E₁-G and G-b₁-d.
m2	657,2402,1283,2546		The chain of chords of the modern minor mode, f - a¹♭ + C - E¹♭ + G + b₁ - d: round braces above join the minor chords f-a¹♭-C and C-E¹♭-G, square braces below the major chords a¹♭-C-E¹♭ and G-b₁-d.
